OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies burglary at snooker
OL,4,Astar's home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA judge has set a trial date after a
OL,7,Fman was accused of burgling the home of
OL,8,Fformer world snooker champion Kyren
OL,9,FWilson.
OL,11,FKane Lee, 27, of Albert Road, Luton,
OL,12,Fdenied burglary during a hearing at
OL,13,FNorthampton Crown Court on Wednesday.
OL,15,FHe has been accused of stealing cash,
OL,16,Fjewellery, watches and handbags from a
OL,17,Fproperty in Kettering,
OL,18,FNorthamptonshire, in June.
OL,20,FJudge Adrienne Lucking said a trial
OL,21,Fwould be listed to start on 4 January
OL,22,F2027.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
